      "value": "<p>You Set a Spotlight on the target that does not move. The creature gains the star contestant role for the duration of the spell, in addition to their normally assigned role.</p><p>The star contestant can turn their bad luck into a thrilling turnabout. When the star contestant fails a check, it gains a +1 status bonus the next time it attempts the check.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.conditions.Item.WZTn5onQlTenBGi5]{Effect: Spotlight}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.conditions.Item.vYCY3uEYojvomVFi]{Effect: Role}</p><hr><p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> Increase the status bonus to a +2.</p>"
